codex
The failure is now localized: this container reports namespace-local PIDs from `getpid()` but `/proc/<pid>/exe` is absent, while `/proc/self/exe` works. Lean 4.22 resolves its installation through `/proc/<pid>/exe`, so I’ll use a narrowly scoped preload shim that only redirects that lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not touch Lean terms, project files, or proof behavior. I’ll preserve the failing and corrected runs as evidence.
apply patch
